SUMMARY:Vijay Iyer Trio
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Waterfront Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Pianist Vijay Iyer\, a MacArthur "genius grant" recipient\, leads his trio in dense\, intellectually rigorous\, genre-crossing jazz. Trumpeter Adam O'Farrill\, grandson of Afro-Cuban jazz pioneer Chico O'Farrill\, joins as special guest.
